# Mapbox access token for the basemap.
#
# Create one at https://account.mapbox.com/access-tokens/ — a free account
# covers the volume this app generates. A public (pk.*) token is correct: it is
# inlined into the client bundle, which is how Mapbox GL is designed to work.
# Scope it to the styles API and restrict it by URL for anything deployed.
#
# Leaving this unset is supported. The map then renders an empty basemap with a
# coordinate graticule, and everything else — panning, zooming, corridors,
# geofences and the whole fleet — keeps working.
NEXT_PUBLIC_MAPBOX_TOKEN=
